{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "blur-reveal",
  "title": "模糊揭示",
  "description": "用于让子元素依次从模糊状态淡入上移进场的揭示动画组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "magic-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "模糊淡入动画的持续时间。",
      "default": "1"
    },
    {
      "name": "delay",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "子组件依次揭示的延迟。",
      "default": "2"
    },
    {
      "name": "blur",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "应用于子组件的模糊量。",
      "default": "\"20px\""
    },
    {
      "name": "yOffset",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "入场动画的垂直偏移距离。",
      "default": "20"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/blur-reveal/BlurRevealDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页标题与副标题依次模糊淡入的首屏动画。",
    "多个子元素需要按顺序逐个进场的内容区块。",
    "需要自定义模糊量（blur）与垂直偏移（yOffset）的入场效果。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要色块滑开式的揭示效果，改用 box-reveal。",
    "文字逐词淡入生成，改用 text-generate-effect。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 motion-v。",
    "duration 与 delay 单位为秒（默认 1 和 2），delay 控制子元素间的依次揭示间隔。",
    "子内容通过默认插槽传入，示例中外层包裹了 ClientOnly。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "motion-v"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add blur-reveal"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
